00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:08.220
So what are the advantages of
storing newspaper on its edge?

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.880
I'll quickly note two. It's
easier to retrieve a piece of

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:15.690
