its edge than from a pile of

00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:19.260
papers, right. And it's also
easier to find something

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:23.160
specific. So loose paper can be
grouped together with other

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:26.400
relevant pieces of paper,
regardless of when it was

