wish you were me. And so one day

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:54.570
though, I arrived at records for
1906. That year is forever

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:57.780
etched in my mind. Because that
year, the State Department

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:02.400
