00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:24.210
So subject trumped chronology,
right. And this completely

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:28.860
changed my research and it made
it possible to find documents I

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.470
wanted with limited effort.

